|---|---|---|
| `results/sample_pca.png` | `figure` | PCA scatter plot of the six samples, coloured by condition |
| `results/sample_pca_coordinates.csv` | `table` | PC1 and PC2 coordinates, sample ID, condition, and explained variance metadata |

